OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian couple and teenage
OL,4,Adaughter who died in water off Shoreham
OL,5,Anamed by police
OL,6,
OL,7,FSussex Police believe all four entered
OL,8,Fthe water for a swim, though details
OL,9,Fabout the circumstances of the incident
OL,10,Fare not yet known
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it "a
OL,13,Freal terrible family tragedy" and warns
OL,14,Fabout "the dangers of open water
OL,15,Fswimming"
OL,17,FFloral tributes have been left at the
OL,18,Fscene, with residents speaking of their
OL,19,F"shock" following the incident which
OL,20,Fhas been described as an "absolute
OL,21,Ftragedy"
